{
  "spec": "Pico FX clips — the animation-side counterpart to the 15 vfx/* entries in asset_manifest_reference.json. The contract's .anim format keyframes BONES only; FX are slot attachments (fx_front, z 200), so an FX clip is a timed key sequence over {region, x, y, scale, rot, alpha} instead of bone deltas. Numeric fields interpolate between keys (linear unless ease set); 'region' changes discretely at the key time. Missing fields hold the previous key's value. x/y are px offsets from the clip anchor on the 2048x2048 master canvas.",
